      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرْجُولٌ</span></b>  A gazelle <i>whose</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِجْل</span> [or <i>hind leg</i>] <i>has
fallen</i> [<i>and is caught</i>] <i>in the snare:</i> when his <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَد</span>
[or fore leg] has fallen therein, he is said to be
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَيْدِىٌّ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also the next preceding
paragraph.

